# dotnet build 复制进 UPM 嵌入包的程序集与语言资源：
# 文件本身不提交，对应的 .meta 需要提交以固定 GUID 和导入设置。
/unity/SkyKeyYuyan.Unity/Packages/*/Plugins/*.dll
/unity/SkyKeyYuyan.Unity/Packages/*/Plugins/*.pdb
/unity/SkyKeyYuyan.Unity/Packages/*/Plugins/*.xml
/unity/SkyKeyYuyan.Unity/Packages/*/Data/**
!/unity/SkyKeyYuyan.Unity/Packages/*/Data/**/
!/unity/SkyKeyYuyan.Unity/Packages/*/Data/**/*.meta

